<p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/images/2015/Rock-Spring2.jpg" alt="Plein air painting at Rock Spring Farm in Leesburg VA" width="350" height="482" /></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Rock Spring Pond (plein air). 7x5, oil on linen panel. 2015</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">This small sketch was done in an impressionistic style with a very compressed value range.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">It was a humid, overcast day and there was no strong light. To avoid creating a somber mood I keyed the painting off the darks in the trees which I set at a middle value. I worked up into the lighter values from there, adding some color contrasts in a few areas to breathe a bit of life into the scene.</p>